    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17398" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλᾰκ-ίζω</span></b> :—
			Med.
		, fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					326.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>:—<i>trace furrows on, plough,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδάφη</span>
			<u>PFlor.</u> l.c.:—
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				331.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλακισμέναν
				ἀροῦν,</span> prov. of doing work over again,
				Pratin.Lyr.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>: metaph. of a shooting star <i>leaving a trail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cat.Cod.Astr.
				8(3).182
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλά̆κ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
				Dim. of
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὖλαξ,</span> Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
				p.196H.
			</span></i></div>
